    "short_description": "Zeta is a banking technology company founded in 2015 and based in Bangalore, India. It offers a cloud-native, API-first neo-banking platform that includes a digital core and payment engine for credit, debit, and prepaid products. Zeta's services cover a range of functionalities such as credit and debit card processing, Buy Now Pay Later (BNPL), core banking, mobile experiences, fraud detection, loyalty programs, lending, and digital banking app capabilities.\n\nThe company provides specialized product suites, including the Tachyon Suite for launching neo-banks and the Cipher Suite for payment solutions. Zeta's products are designed for banks and fintech institutions, helping them to modernize their retail and corporate offerings. With over 35 global clients, Zeta has facilitated the issuance of more than 15 million cards across various regions, including India, Asia, LATAM, the US, UK, and the Middle East.",
